# What `gcloud builds submit api` uploads to the build bucket: only what the
# Dockerfile needs (an allow-list). Nothing else on the laptop goes, whatever
# appears in api/ later: no .env or key files, caches, tests or virtualenv.
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!src/**
src/**/__pycache__/

# Credentials never go, even inside src/ (same patterns as the root .gitignore).
.env
.env.*
*credentials*.json
*-key.json
service-account*.json
